<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cross-Continent raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cross-Continent raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said it upgraded Cross-Continent Auto Retailers Inc to a buy from a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- cited Cross-Continental's attractive valuation, confidence that aquisition pace will accelerate and company's decision to add James Purser, an acquisition expert, as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>-- Cross-Continent gained 1-1/4 to 16.</p>
</text>
